<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Midwest Express cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Midwest Express cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Midwest Express Holdings Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- cut second quarter estimate to $0.58 a share from $0.69 a share and cut the year-end estimate to $2.38 a share from $2.49 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects second quarter passenger yields to show a 4.5 to 5.0 decline compared to last year.</p>
<p>-- said believes shares of Midwest Express will see downward pressure.</p>
<p>-- Midwest Express gained 1-5/16 to 25-1/4.</p>
</text>
